                  </p>
                  <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm md:text-base mb-4">
                    <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-teal-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow md:col-span-2">
